illain at it an empathetic reaction  is about as likely as a bachelor and  paradise couple surviving their third  anniversary rue explicitly points out  the chronic lack of empathy in the world  everyone's just out to make everyone  else not seem human  i don't really want to be a part of it  rue's response as a nihilistic kid is  understandable but the only way to  surpass these kinds of hasty judgments  is empathy and when we do choose to be a  part of it it can be a rewarding and  uniquely modern experience but what do  you guys think is euphoria the most  compelling show on television is my  heart being broken every week for no  reason let us know in the comments big  thanks to our patrons for all your  support and be sure to check out our  podcast hit that subscribe button like  you're desperately pausing the tv when  your parents walk in and don't forget to  ring that bell and as always thanks for  watching  later  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

